# DS-0002 / AVD-DS-0002: Image user should not be 'root'
# Both production Dockerfiles (backend/Dockerfile, frontend/Dockerfile) specify
# unprivileged non-root users (appuser / nginx). This rule is only ignored for
# .clusterfuzzlite/Dockerfile, which is a build-only CI container based on
# gcr.io/oss-fuzz-base/base-builder-python where root is required by OSS-Fuzz's
# compile_python_fuzzer build toolchain to write into /out ($OUT).
DS-0002
AVD-DS-0002
